{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fitzenix-api-collection-v1-missing",
    "name": "Fitzenix API \u2014 Missing APIs (collection1)",
    "description": "Extra Fitzenix endpoints NOT in the main Fitzenix API collection.\\n\\nHow to use:\\n1. Import this file into Postman (Import \u2192 Upload Files).\\n2. Reuse the same variables as the main collection: baseUrl, accessToken, gymId, memberId, userId, notificationId, etc.\\n3. Log in via the main collection first (or paste accessToken here).\\n4. Money amounts are INR paise integers.\\n\\nCovers: Notifications, Finance, Enquiries, Attendance extras, Fitness templates, Users avatar, Reports activity/user-growth, Memberships my-plan + platform, Super Admin gym create + platform finance.\\n\\nSmoke (Super Admin \u2014 login as admin@fitzenix.com):\\n1) POST auth/login \u2192 set accessToken\\n2) GET /reports/dashboard (or platform) \u2014 KPIs + deltas\\n3) GET /reports/user-growth?months=6\\n4) GET /gyms \u2192 POST /gyms (create) \u2192 GET /gyms/:id\\n5) PATCH /gyms/:id/status {status:suspended}\\n6) GET /users?limit=20 \u2192 GET /users/:id\\n7) GET /finance/platform/summary \u2192 GET /finance/platform/transactions\\n8) GET /memberships/platform/summary \u2192 GET /memberships/platform/subscriptions\\n9) GET /notifications \u2192 PATCH read / POST read-all\\nApp: Dashboard KPIs \u2192 Gyms \u2192 Add/Detail \u2192 Users \u2192 Detail \u2192 Finance \u2192 Subscriptions \u2192 Notifications",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
